# Next.js App Router

- Use server components by default; client components only when state, effects, or browser APIs are required.
- Use file-based routing, `layout.tsx` for shared chrome, `loading.tsx` / `error.tsx` where useful.
- Use TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and Next.js naming conventions.
- Keep components reusable; prefer existing project patterns over new abstractions.
- Do not invent 3D engines, blockchain, or background AI loops in Stage 1 of NEXUS.
